D7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7svjXaOKO5638eYiymNP2A","review_id":"zW3c6OsuH7Z6C4WjmGLpxg","date":"2016-12-09T22:57:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9015458822250366,"text_excerpt":"The staff were so welcoming and nice. A friend and I walked over there a bit after 1 on a Friday and the owner just got there and was opening the store (seems like flexible hours). But he and the staff were really friendly and let us have samples before ordering. I had the rose sweet tea and my friend had a coffee. I liked mine. My friend said the coffee wasnt really good but Im rating the place well for the service and environment. Hehe. We read for a couple hours in the front room and there weren't any other customers then - seems like they attract younger kids when they get off school. After we paid, the lady knew we were visiting the area and gave us some suggestions for things to do ..."},{"business_id":"7svjXaOKO5638eYiymNP2A","review_id":"HN3x8JZsUsUtBidnn1Dxaw","date":"2016-01-26T18:41:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8953494429588318,"text_excerpt":"So many good things to be said about this place. The vegan brunch is what originally sparked my interest in the place. It took me a few tried to make it to Algiers during brunch hours because of other things I had going on but once I had a meal there I knew I had to plan my Sunday almost around making it there. The brunch is vegan and contained an array of courses. It started with their famous sweet potato pancakes that actually had visible pieces of sweet potato in it. Usually there is a salad in between the pancake and the main course. There is also a dessert to finish off the meal. The food isn't the best part about this place though, the ambience is amazing as well. You get the feel o..."},{"business_id":"7svjXaOKO5638eYiymNP2A","review_id":"Q8EF1bAquL-vl2FtJtY1nQ","date":"2014-06-26T09:22:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.889901876449585,"text_excerpt":"Very Afro-Centric establishment with poetry readings to help give back to the community. Poetry is very important for our youth to have a positive outlet and this place provides an open mic night for them to express their feelings. This place also has the best sammiches I've ever had! They also serve coffee but I never got around to trying it. I know the owner personally and he is a man with a big heart!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7svjXaOKO5638eYiymNP2A","photo_id":"Xo1plbCPvG6O_FAW1c1AsA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Xo1plbCPvG6O_FAW1c1AsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9085485339164734},{"business_id":"7svjXaOKO5638eYiymNP2A","photo_id":"lsU6ZxCVlRUB_eaGBsSleg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lsU6ZxCVlRUB_eaGBsSleg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9042745232582092},{"business_id":"7svjXaOKO5638eYiymNP2A","photo_id":"G3HC7DCBFUCb4cNA_VUnLQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/G3HC7DCBFUCb4cNA_VUnLQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8401792049407959}]},"notebook_case":null}
